title: Funding for Ministries
subtitle: the budget is to be decided now...
view-if: year = 1951 and month = 5 and spd_in_government = 1
tags: event
go-to: budmon

@budmon 

The previous government of Sordland has ignored education and prioritized military spending. What we do now is up to our best judgement. Economic Growth is also affected by our decisions here(do note that the budget changes mentioned here are for your CURRENT budget in the other window).

- @milfund: Change Funding for the Military.
- @edfund: Change Funding for Education.
- @justfund: Change Funding for Law and Order.
- @healthfund: Change Funding for Healthcare.
- @buddone: We have done enough.


@milfund

We have decided to change funding for the Military.

- @milplus: Increase Funding for the Military.
- @milnorm: Maintain Funding for the Military.
- @milless: Reduce Funding for the Military.
- @back1: Return...

@milplus
subtitle: -3 budget
view-if: military_funding = 0
on-arrival: military_funding = 1
go-to: milfund

@milnorm
subtitle: No change to budget
view-if: military_funding = 1 or military_funding = -1
on-arrival: military_funding = 0
go-to: milfund

@milless
subtitle: +3 budget
view-if: military_funding = 0 or military_funding = 1
on-arrival: military_funding = -1
go-to: milfund

@back1
go-to: budmon


@edfund

We have decided to change funding for Education.

- @edplus: Increase Funding for Education.
- @ednorm: Maintain Funding for Education.
- @edless: Reduce Funding for Education.
- @back2: Return...

@edplus
subtitle: -2 budget
view-if: education_funding = 0
on-arrival: education_funding = 1
go-to: edfund

@ednorm
subtitle: No change to budget
view-if: education_funding = 1 or education_funding = -1
on-arrival: education_funding = 0
go-to: edfund

@edless
subtitle: +2 budget
view-if: education_funding = 0 or education_funding = 1
on-arrival: education_funding = -1
go-to: edfund

@back2
go-to: budmon



@justfund

We have decided to change funding for Law and Order.

- @justplus: Increase Funding for Law and Order.
- @justnorm: Maintain Funding for Law and Order.
- @justless: Reduce Funding for Law and Order.
- @back3: Return...

@justplus
subtitle: -2 budget
view-if: interior_funding = 0
on-arrival: interior_funding = 1
go-to: justfund

@justnorm
subtitle: No change to budget
view-if: education_funding = 1 or education_funding = -1
on-arrival: interior_funding = 0
go-to: justfund

@justless
subtitle: +2 budget
view-if: education_funding = 0 or education_funding = 1
on-arrival: interior_funding = -1
go-to: justfund

@back3
go-to: budmon



@healthfund

We have decided to change funding for Healthcare.

- @healthplus: Increase Funding for Healthcare.
- @healthnorm: Maintain Funding for Healthcare.
- @healthless: Reduce Funding for the Healthcare.
- @back4: Return...

@healthplus
subtitle: -1 budget
view-if: health_funding = 0
on-arrival: health_funding = 1
go-to: healthfund

@healthnorm
subtitle: No change to budget
view-if: health_funding = 1 or health_funding = -1
on-arrival: health_funding = 0
go-to: healthfund

@healthless
subtitle: +1 budget
view-if: health_funding = 0 or health_funding = 1
on-arrival: health_funding = -1
go-to: healthfund

@back4
go-to: budmon

@buddone
on-arrival: budget -= 3 if military_funding = 1; budget += 3 if military_funding = -1; budget -= 2 if education_funding = 1; budget += 2 if education_funding = -1; budget -= 2 if justice_funding = 1; budget += 2 if justice_funding = -1; budget += 1 if health_funding = -1; budget -= 1 if health_funding = 1

We have finished deciding our budget for each ministry.
